OL,3,GNEWSATwo further arrests over Armadale
OL,4,Ashooting death
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo more men aged 34 and 44 have been
OL,7,Farrested over the death of a man who
OL,8,Fwas shot in West Lothian.
OL,10,FBilly Watson, 35, was fatally injured
OL,11,Fin a property on Harestanes Road,
OL,12,FArmadale, at about 11:50 on Saturday 12
OL,13,FSeptember.
OL,15,FFour men, aged 57, 44, 29 and 20, were
OL,16,Fpreviously arrested and charged in
OL,17,Fconnection with his death. They have
OL,18,Fall appeared in court.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
